---
title: MCP Context Assistant — Retrieval Flow
---
flowchart TD
    A([User Query]) --> B{PromptGuardrails}
    B -->|blocked| C([⛔ Blocked Response])
    B -->|safe| D[EmbeddingService\nall-MiniLM-L6-v2\nFREE local model]
    D --> E[(ChromaDB\nVector Store\nCosine Similarity)]
    E --> F[Top-K Chunks\nwith scores]
    F --> G[ContextManager\n• Rank by score\n• Deduplicate\n• Token budgeting\n• Source headers]
    G --> H[MemoryManager\nPrepend session history]
    H --> I[Prompt Assembly\nSystem + Context + History + Query]
    I --> J{LLM Provider}
    J -->|Anthropic| K[Claude API]
    J -->|Ollama| L[Local LLaMA/Mistral]
    J -->|Mock| M[Test Response]
    K --> N[Answer + Sources]
    L --> N
    M --> N
    N --> O[MemoryManager\nStore turn]
    O --> P([Response to User\n+ source citations\n+ metadata])

    style A fill:#7c3aed,color:#fff
    style P fill:#059669,color:#fff
    style C fill:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style E fill:#1e40af,color:#fff
    style J fill:#92400e,color:#fff
